      "text": "春种一粒粟",
      "pinyin": "chūn zhòng yī lì sù",
      "cn": "春天播种下一粒谷物",
      "en": "In spring, a single grain of millet is sown;",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p3_l1.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "秋收万颗子",
      "pinyin": "qiū shōu wàn kē zǐ",
      "cn": "秋天收获无数的粮食",
      "en": "In autumn, ten thousand seeds are harvested.",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p3_l2.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "四海无闲田",
      "pinyin": "sì hǎi wú xián tián",
      "cn": "天下没有荒废不种的田地",
      "en": "Across the four seas, no farmland lies idle,",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p3_l3.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "农夫犹饿死",
      "pinyin": "nóng fū yóu è sǐ",
      "cn": "可是耕种的农夫还是饿死了",
      "en": "Yet the peasant farmers still starve to death.",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p3_l4.webp"
    }
  ],
